{"availability":"available","full":"Zolfikaar/product-feedback-app","name":"product-feedback-app","description":"A challenge on Frontend Mentor to build a product feedback app","category":"Other","language":"Vue","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2023-12-03T01:11:49Z","updated":"2026-08-17T20:11:59Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://zolfikaar.github.io/product-feedback-app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:22.401Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:22.401Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:22.401Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:37:22.401Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fully interactive product feedback board that lets users browse suggestions, filter and sort requests, upvote ideas, leave nested comments, and track delivery progress on a visual roadmap. Built as a solution to the Frontend Mentor Product Feedback App challenge.","This single-page application replicates a product-management feedback workflow. Seed data is loaded from a JSON mock API, then all subsequent reads and writes — votes, comments, replies, and CRUD operations — persist in the browser via localStorage, so the board stays in sync after a refresh.","Replace the image above with a current screenshot of the home, roadmap, or details view."],"features":["🧭 Suggestions board — Browse product requests with title, description, category tag, upvote count, and comment count on a dedicated home view.","🏷️ Category filtering — Filter suggestions from the sidebar by All or by a live category list derived from the data (feature, enhancement, bug, and any custom tags).","↕️ Sorting — Sort the board by Most upvotes, Least upvotes, Most comments, or Least comments from the top-bar dropdown (defaults to most upvotes).","➕ Create feedback — Add a new request with title, category (custom dropdown), and detail fields. New items are stored as suggestion with zero upvotes.","✏️ Edit fee